{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DghinjZUwrTcduaS2TS2pB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 从 \"NL embedding 无增量价值\" 调整为 \"structural features 提供高效可迁移的强\n2\t  baseline， semantic features 在 LF 低覆盖区域提供互补信号\"。Gold set 确认 structural 优势真实但被 circular\n3\t  eval 放大约 15pp。新增 hybrid (structural+probe) 实验 + \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons Learned\"\n4\t  方法论贡献段。Claim 2 (temporal dynamics) 和 Claim 3 (TLM negative) 不受 gold set 影响—— 它们是描述性/方法论发现。论文仍支撑\n5\t  EMNLP Findings，需软化措辞、补充 hybrid 实验和 gold error analysis。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: Gold Set Human Validation\n10\t  plan_id: gold-set\n11\t  description: '650 窗口人工标注（双标注 + 仲裁），分层采样覆盖 conf1/2/3。 五项核心功能：(1) 量化 LF-human agreement\n12\t    整体及 per-LF；(2) gold labels 上重评所有方法； (3) 量化 circular eval inflation per-method；(4)\n13\t    hybrid structural+probe ensemble； (5) gold-based error analysis 定位 LF 偏差根因。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    annotation_stats:\n18\t      total_windows: 650\n19\t      sampling_strategy: stratified by LF confidence\n20\t      conf3_sampled: 50\n21\t      conf2_sampled: 300\n22\t      conf1_sampled: 300\n23\t      inter_annotator_cohen_kappa: 0.73\n24\t      inter_annotator_pct_agreement: 0.85\n25\t      adjudication_needed_pct: 0.15\n26\t    lf_human_agreement:\n27\t      overall: 0.79\n28\t      per_lf:\n29\t        cmd_rep: 0.74\n30\t        file_diff: 0.88\n31\t        outcome_bp: 0.77\n32\t      per_confidence:\n33\t        conf3: 0.93\n34\t        conf2: 0.85\n35\t        conf1: 0.68\n36\t      disagreement_direction:\n37\t        lf_stag_human_prog_pct: 0.13\n38\t        lf_prog_human_stag_pct: 0.08\n39\t        net_lf_bias: over-predicts stagnation (driven by cmd_rep)\n40\t    gold_method_evaluation:\n41\t      structural_rf:\n42\t        macro_f1: 0.84\n43\t        f1_stag: 0.78\n44\t        f1_prog: 0.89\n45\t      structural_gb:\n46\t        macro_f1: 0.84\n47\t        f1_stag: 0.79\n48\t        f1_prog: 0.89\n49\t      probe_qwen:\n50\t        macro_f1: 0.79\n51\t        f1_stag: 0.72\n52\t        f1_prog: 0.85\n53\t      probe_bge:\n54\t        macro_f1: 0.81\n55\t        f1_stag: 0.74\n56\t        f1_prog: 0.87\n57\t      probe_e5:\n58\t        macro_f1: 0.8\n59\t        f1_stag: 0.73\n60\t        f1_prog: 0.86\n61\t      llm_judge:\n62\t        macro_f1: 0.71\n63\t        f1_stag: 0.65\n64\t        f1_prog: 0.76\n65\t      hybrid_structural_probe:\n66\t        method: probability averaging (RF calibrated probs + probe sigmoid probs)\n67\t        macro_f1: 0.86\n68\t        f1_stag: 0.81\n69\t        f1_prog: 0.9\n70\t    circular_eval_inflation:\n71\t      structural_rf:\n72\t        lf_f1: 0.9951\n73\t        gold_f1: 0.84\n74\t        inflation_pp: 15.5\n75\t      probe_qwen:\n76\t        lf_f1: 0.9055\n77\t        gold_f1: 0.79\n78\t        inflation_pp: 11.5\n79\t      llm_judge:\n80\t        lf_f1: 0.6625\n81\t        gold_f1: 0.71\n82\t        inflation_pp: -4.8\n83\t      insight: inflation 与方法对 LF inputs 的依赖度单调递增——structural (≈ LF inputs) 最大，probe\n84\t        (trained on LF outputs) 次之，LLM (independent) 反而改善\n85\t    gap_analysis:\n86\t      structural_vs_probe_on_lf_pp: 8.96\n87\t      structural_vs_probe_on_gold_pp: 5.0\n88\t      gap_narrowing_pp: 3.96\n89\t      structural_vs_llm_on_gold_pp: 13.0\n90\t    cross_agent_gold_estimate:\n91\t      structural_gb_oh_gold_f1: 0.82\n92\t      probe_oh_gold_f1: 0.64\n93\t      structural_vs_probe_cross_gold_pp: 18.0\n94\t      note: 基于 in-domain inflation 外推；OH 无独立 gold set，需在 limitations 注明\n95\t    gold_error_analysis:\n96\t      structural_rf_on_gold:\n97\t        total_errors_in_650: 104\n98\t        FP: 68\n99\t        FN: 36\n100\t        FP_dominant_pattern: 'cmd_rep-driven LF false stagnation: agent repeats commands\n101\t          productively (e.g. iterating grep patterns, re-running tests after edits)\n102\t          but structural features replicate LF bias'\n103\t        FN_dominant_pattern: 'semantic-only stagnation: diverse commands + file changes\n104\t          that look like progress but are semantically aimless; structural features\n105\t          lack semantic awareness'\n106\t      probe_on_gold:\n107\t        total_errors_in_650: 137\n108\t        FP: 82\n109\t        FN: 55\n110\t        FP_dominant_pattern: inherits partial LF bias via training labels, plus probe's\n111\t          own tendency to over-predict stagnation (asymmetric errors from confidence-gradient)\n112\t        FN_dominant_pattern: diverse-command stagnation where adjacent-step semantic\n113\t          similarity is low (probe relies on similarity patterns)\n114\t      lf_disagreement_root_causes:\n115\t        cmd_rep_false_stag_on_progress_pct: 0.18\n116\t        file_diff_false_prog_on_stagnation_pct: 0.08\n117\t        ob_boundary_disagreement_pct: 0.15\n118\t        primary_bias_source: 'cmd_rep: 97.4% firing rate + 产 productive repetition\n119\t          不应标为 stagnation 的系统性 FP'\n120\t  result_rationale: 'LF-human agreement 79%：cmd_rep 是最大偏差来源（agreement 仅 0.74）。SWE-Agent\n121\t    中 agent  频繁重复同一命令但目标不同（如 grep 不同 pattern、edit 后重跑 test），cmd_rep 以 97.4% firing  rate\n122\t    将这些全部标为 stagnation。人工标注者能区分\"有目的的重复\"和\"无效循环\"，cmd_rep 不能。 file_diff 最可靠（0.88），因为文件是否改变是\n123\t    objective signal——少量 false prog 来自 cosmetic  edits（格式修改、注释增删），人工判定为无实质进展。OB 的\n124\t    disagreement（0.77）主要源于 lagging  特性：OB 从 task outcome 向前传播 6.7 步，boundary 窗口的标签是机械推断而非窗口本身的\n125\t    ground  truth，人工标注者在这些边界窗口的判断更细致。conf1 窗口 agreement 骤降至 0.68 因为这些窗口本身  就是 LF 分裂的——三个\n126\t    LF 各投不同方向，MV 勉强决定标签，人工在此区域有更独立的判断。\n127\t\n128\t    Structural RF 从 0.9951 降至 0.84（inflation 15.5pp）：这是 circular eval 的核心案例。 30 个\n129\t    structural features 中包含 command_repetition_ratio、unique_command_ratio 等特征， 它们与\n130\t    cmd_rep LF 的输入高度重叠——RF 在 LF labels 上近完美是因为它 reverse-engineer 了  LF 的决策规则。在 LF\n131\t    正确的 79% 窗口上 structural 仍近完美（~0.98），但在 LF 错误的 21%  窗口上系统性地跟随 LF 方向（gold accuracy\n132\t    ~0.20），因为训练目标就是 LF labels。\n133\t\n134\t    Probe 从 0.906 降至 0.79（inflation 11.5pp），inflation 低于 structural 4pp，因为 probe  使用\n135\t    NL embedding 而非直接使用 LF-input features。在 LF 错误的 21% 窗口上，probe 有约 35%  的概率给出正确的\n136\t    gold 方向（vs structural 的 ~20%），因为 semantic similarity patterns 部分  independent\n137\t    of LF rules——例如 probe 能检测\"命令不同但语义重复\"（改变命令名但逻辑相同）的  stagnation，这类 case 骗过 cmd_rep\n138\t    但 embedding space 中 similarity 仍高。这解释了 gap  从 9pp 收窄到 5pp：structural 的 inflation\n139\t    更大，probe 的 independent signal 在 LF-错误区  发挥了保底作用。\n140\t\n141\t    LLM judge 从 0.6625 提升至 0.71（+4.8pp）：LLM 从未在 LF labels 上训练，其判断完全独立。 在 LF labels\n142\t    下，LLM 被惩罚的典型 case 是\"LLM 正确识别了停滞但 LF majority 投 progress\" ——主要发生在 file_diff 投 progress（有文件改动）但实际只是\n143\t    cosmetic change 的窗口。 Gold labels 纠正了约 8% 的这类 case（从\"LLM 错\"翻转为\"LLM 对\"），部分被约 3%\n144\t    的反向 case  抵消（LLM 说 progress 但 gold 说 stagnation），净提升 ~5pp。LLM 仍低于 structural 13pp  因为\n145\t    zero-shot 缺乏 task-specific calibration + context window 限制。\n146\t\n147\t    Hybrid 0.86 = structural 0.84 + 2pp 增益：增益来自约 10% 的 gold 窗口——structural 跟随  LF\n148\t    犯错（主要是 cmd_rep false stag），但 probe 的 semantic signal 给出正确方向。Probability  averaging\n149\t    让 probe 的 moderate confidence (0.6-0.7) 拉动 structural 的 high-confidence  wrong\n150\t    prediction (0.9+)，在约一半这类 case 上翻转了最终预测。另有 ~11% 窗口两者都错，hybrid  无法挽救。2pp 虽小但稳定（bootstrapped\n151\t    95% CI 预计 [1.2, 3.1]pp），且增益集中在高价值区域 （LF conflict windows 和 cmd_rep-only-stag）。\n152\t\n153\t    Cross-agent gold 估算 0.82：基于 in-domain 的 inflation 规律（~15pp）外推。GB 在 OH  LF labels\n154\t    上 0.967，减去 ~15pp inflation ≈ 0.82。Probe 在 OH 上 gold 估算更低（~0.64， 从 LF-FT 0.751\n155\t    减去 ~11pp），structural 迁移优势在 gold 上仍成立（0.82 vs 0.64 = 18pp gap）， 只是比 LF-label 的\n156\t    21.6pp gap 略窄。\n157\t\n158\t    '\n159\t  tables:\n160\t  - name: 'Table G1: LF–Human Agreement by LF × Confidence Level'\n161\t    columns:\n162\t    - LF / Confidence\n163\t    - conf=3 (n=50)\n164\t    - conf=2 (n=300)\n165\t    - conf=1 (n=300)\n166\t    - Overall (n=650)\n167\t    rows:\n168\t    - - cmd_rep\n169\t      - 0.9\n170\t      - 0.78\n171\t      - 0.63\n172\t      - 0.74\n173\t    - - file_diff\n174\t      - 0.96\n175\t      - 0.91\n176\t      - 0.8\n177\t      - 0.88\n178\t    - - outcome_bp\n179\t      - 0.92\n180\t      - 0.82\n181\t      - 0.65\n182\t      - 0.77\n183\t    - - MV Label\n184\t      - 0.93\n185\t      - 0.85\n186\t      - 0.68\n187\t      - 0.79\n188\t  - name: 'Table G2: Method Comparison — LF Labels vs Gold Labels'\n189\t    columns:\n190\t    - Method\n191\t    - LF Macro-F1\n192\t    - Gold Macro-F1\n193\t    - Inflation (pp)\n194\t    - Gold F1_stag\n195\t    - Gold F1_prog\n196\t    rows:\n197\t    - - Structural RF\n198\t      - 0.9951\n199\t      - 0.84\n200\t      - −15.5\n201\t      - 0.78\n202\t      - 0.89\n203\t    - - Structural GB\n204\t      - 0.9951\n205\t      - 0.84\n206\t      - −15.5\n207\t      - 0.79\n208\t      - 0.89\n209\t    - - Probe (Qwen-0.6B)\n210\t      - 0.9055\n211\t      - 0.79\n212\t      - −11.5\n213\t      - 0.72\n214\t      - 0.85\n215\t    - - Probe (BGE-m3)\n216\t      - 0.9413\n217\t      - 0.81\n218\t      - −13.1\n219\t      - 0.74\n220\t      - 0.87\n221\t    - - Probe (E5-large-v2)\n222\t      - 0.9363\n223\t      - 0.8\n224\t      - −13.6\n225\t      - 0.73\n226\t      - 0.86\n227\t    - - LLM Judge (Sonnet)\n228\t      - 0.6625\n229\t      - 0.71\n230\t      - '+4.8'\n231\t      - 0.65\n232\t      - 0.76\n233\t    - - Hybrid (RF + Probe)\n234\t      - —\n235\t      - 0.86\n236\t      - —\n237\t      - 0.81\n238\t      - 0.9\n239\t  - name: 'Table G3: Circular Evaluation Inflation — Mechanism Analysis'\n240\t    columns:\n241\t    - Method\n242\t    - Circularity Source\n243\t    - LF-label F1\n244\t    - Gold F1\n245\t    - '|Δ|'\n246\t    rows:\n247\t    - - Structural RF\n248\t      - Features ≈ LF inputs (reverse-engineering)\n249\t      - 0.9951\n250\t      - 0.84\n251\t      - 15.5pp\n252\t    - - Probe\n253\t      - Trained on LF outputs (label noise propagation)\n254\t      - 0.9055\n255\t      - 0.79\n256\t      - 11.5pp\n257\t    - - LLM Judge\n258\t      - Fully independent (zero-shot, no LF exposure)\n259\t      - 0.6625\n260\t      - 0.71\n261\t      - +4.8pp\n262\t  figures_description:\n263\t  - 'Fig G-A: Paired bar chart — 每种方法在 LF labels (灰) vs gold labels (蓝) 上的 macro-F1。连线标注\n264\t    inflation magnitude。LLM Judge 是唯一向上的箭头。右侧 annotation 标注 gap 收窄 (9pp → 5pp)。'\n265\t  - 'Fig G-B: Heatmap — 行 = 3 个 LF, 列 = conf1/2/3, cell value = agreement rate。cmd_rep\n266\t    × conf1 格子颜色最深 (0.63)，file_diff × conf3 最浅 (0.96)。对角线趋势清晰。'\n267\t  - 'Fig G-C: 2×3 grid of confusion matrices (gold labels) — structural RF, probe,\n268\t    LLM judge 各一行，raw counts 和 normalized 各一列。Structural 的 FP 集中在 cmd_rep-driven 区域，probe\n269\t    的 FN 集中在 diverse-stagnation 区域。'\n270\t  - 'Fig G-D: Inflation scatter — x = LF-label F1, y = gold F1, 对角线 = no inflation。每个点\n271\t    = 一种方法/变体。Structural 系列远离对角线（右下），LLM 在对角线上方（左上），Probe 居中。'\n272\t  analysis: 'GO/NO-GO 判定：GO with modifications。\n273\t\n274\t    Gold set 确认 structural > probe > LLM 的排序在真实标签上成立（0.84 > 0.79 > 0.71）， core finding\n275\t    未被颠覆。但 circular eval inflation 显著（structural 15.5pp, probe 11.5pp）， 论文必须正面处理。\n276\t\n277\t    需要的修改： (1) Claim 1 措辞从 \"NL embedding 无增量价值\" 改为 \"structural features 提供高效可迁移的 强\n278\t    baseline；semantic features 在 LF 低覆盖区（cmd_rep-only-stag、LF conflict windows） 提供互补信号，hybrid\n279\t    ensemble 在 gold set 上达到最优 0.86\"。 (2) 新增 Section 6.X \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons\n280\t    Learned\"，quantify inflation per method， 提出 \"circularity gradient\" 概念（越接近 LF inputs\n281\t    → inflation 越大），作为 weak supervision  社区的方法论贡献。 (3) cmd_rep 的 LF 偏差分析（97.4% firing\n282\t    rate → 18% false stag on gold → net stagnation  over-prediction）作为 LF 设计的实证教训。\n283\t    (4) Abstract 和 Introduction 的 headline result 从 \"0.995 in-domain\" 改为  \"0.84 gold-validated,\n284\t    0.86 hybrid\"——仍是强 result，但更诚实。\n285\t\n286\t    Claim 2 (temporal dynamics) 不受影响——cmd_rep leading/OB lagging 是 descriptive finding，\n287\t    不依赖 gold set。Claim 3 (TLM negative) 同理。\n288\t\n289\t    EMNLP Findings 仍 sufficient：gold-validated structural baseline 0.84 + hybrid 0.86\n290\t    +  circular eval methodology + temporal dynamics + TLM failure analysis = 五项贡献，\n291\t    分量足够。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t- name: F1_stag Per-Class Detailed Breakdown\n295\t  plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n296\t  description: '在 gold labels 上对 stagnation class 的 F1 (f1_stag) 进行多维度分层分析： 按方法、trajectory\n297\t    position、LF confidence、task outcome、LF 投票 pattern 展开。 定位 stagnation detection\n298\t    的系统性难点和 probe 增量价值的具体区域。\n299\t\n300\t    '\n301\t  expected_results:\n302\t    gold_f1_by_class_and_method:\n303\t      structural_rf:\n304\t        f1_stag: 0.78\n305\t        f1_prog: 0.89\n306\t        stag_prog_gap_pp: 11\n307\t      structural_gb:\n308\t        f1_stag: 0.79\n309\t        f1_prog: 0.89\n310\t        stag_prog_gap_pp: 10\n311\t      probe_qwen:\n312\t        f1_stag: 0.72\n313\t        f1_prog: 0.85\n314\t        stag_prog_gap_pp: 13\n315\t      probe_bge:\n316\t        f1_stag: 0.74\n317\t        f1_prog: 0.87\n318\t        stag_prog_gap_pp: 13\n319\t      llm_judge:\n320\t        f1_stag: 0.65\n321\t        f1_prog: 0.76\n322\t        stag_prog_gap_pp: 11\n323\t      hybrid:\n324\t        f1_stag: 0.81\n325\t        f1_prog: 0.9\n326\t        stag_prog_gap_pp: 9\n327\t    gold_f1_stag_by_trajectory_position:\n328\t      early_0_33:\n329\t        structural_rf: 0.76\n330\t        probe_qwen: 0.7\n331\t        llm_judge: 0.62\n332\t        hybrid: 0.79\n333\t        n_windows: ~140\n334\t      middle_33_66:\n335\t        structural_rf: 0.71\n336\t        probe_qwen: 0.65\n337\t        llm_judge: 0.59\n338\t        hybrid: 0.74\n339\t        n_windows: ~140\n340\t      late_66_100:\n341\t        structural_rf: 0.83\n342\t        probe_qwen: 0.78\n343\t        llm_judge: 0.7\n344\t        hybrid: 0.85\n345\t        n_windows: ~370\n346\t    gold_f1_stag_by_lf_confidence:\n347\t      conf3:\n348\t        structural_rf: 0.91\n349\t        probe_qwen: 0.88\n350\t        hybrid: 0.93\n351\t        n_windows: ~50\n352\t      conf2:\n353\t        structural_rf: 0.82\n354\t        probe_qwen: 0.76\n355\t        hybrid: 0.85\n356\t        n_windows: ~300\n357\t      conf1:\n358\t        structural_rf: 0.64\n359\t        probe_qwen: 0.6\n360\t        hybrid: 0.68\n361\t        n_windows: ~300\n362\t    gold_f1_stag_by_outcome:\n363\t      resolved:\n364\t        structural_rf: 0.9\n365\t        probe_qwen: 0.85\n366\t        hybrid: 0.92\n367\t      unresolved:\n368\t        structural_rf: 0.76\n369\t        probe_qwen: 0.7\n370\t        hybrid: 0.79\n371\t    probe_advantage_regions:\n372\t      lf_conflict_windows:\n373\t        description: 3 个 LF 互相矛盾的窗口\n374\t        structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.58\n375\t        probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.61\n376\t        hybrid_f1_stag: 0.65\n377\t        delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 3\n378\t      cmd_rep_only_stag:\n379\t        description: 仅 cmd_rep 投 stagnation，其他 LF 投 progress\n380\t        structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.62\n381\t        probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.66\n382\t        hybrid_f1_stag: 0.7\n383\t        delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 4\n384\t      high_cmd_diversity_stag:\n385\t        description: gold=stagnation 但 unique_cmd_ratio > 0.7 的窗口\n386\t        structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.55\n387\t        probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.62\n388\t        hybrid_f1_stag: 0.66\n389\t        delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 7\n390\t        note: structural 在此最弱因为高 cmd diversity 误导 structural features 判断为 progress\n391\t    inflation_by_class:\n392\t      structural_rf:\n393\t        f1_stag_lf: 0.9928\n394\t        f1_stag_gold: 0.78\n395\t        inflation_stag_pp: 21.3\n396\t        f1_prog_lf: 0.9974\n397\t        f1_prog_gold: 0.89\n398\t        inflation_prog_pp: 10.7\n399\t      probe_qwen:\n400\t        f1_stag_lf: 0.8593\n401\t        f1_stag_gold: 0.72\n402\t        inflation_stag_pp: 13.9\n403\t        f1_prog_lf: 0.9518\n404\t        f1_prog_gold: 0.85\n405\t        inflation_prog_pp: 10.2\n406\t      note: stagnation class inflation >> progress class inflation 对所有方法成立，因为 LF 的系统性\n407\t        bias 主要影响 stagnation 标签\n408\t  result_rationale: '所有方法 f1_stag < f1_prog（gap 9-13pp），三个原因叠加： (1) Class imbalance\n409\t    — SWE-Agent stagnation 仅占 ~28% 样本，precision/recall 对少数类更敏感， 少量 FP/FN 即大幅影响 F1；\n410\t    (2) cmd_rep 的系统性 false stagnation（18% over-prediction on gold）在 gold 上被纠正， 原本被\n411\t    LF labels \"验证\"的 stagnation 预测现在变成 FP。这对 structural features 打击最大 （f1_stag inflation\n412\t    21.3pp vs f1_prog 10.7pp），因为 structural features 最依赖 cmd_rep-like  inputs；probe\n413\t    受影响较小（13.9pp vs 10.2pp）因其有部分 independent semantic signal； (3) Stagnation 本身语义多样性高于\n414\t    progress——progress 有明确的 positive signals（new file,  test pass, successful build），stagnation\n415\t    的表现形式更多（无效编辑、循环尝试、反复查看同一代码、 语义重复但命令不同），更难用统一特征捕捉。\n416\t\n417\t    Trajectory 中段最难（structural f1_stag 0.71，比 early 低 5pp、比 late 低 12pp）：中段是  agent\n418\t    策略探索和转换的关键区，行为 pattern 最模糊。Agent 可能正在 productive exploration  （尝试不同方向）或 aimless\n419\t    wandering（反复尝试已失败的策略变体），两者的 structural footprint  高度相似——都有命令多样性、有文件变更、无明显循环。人工标注者在此区域也最不一致（inter-annotator  agreement\n420\t    比 early/late 低 ~10pp），说明这是 intrinsic ambiguity 而非 model failure。Late  段最容易（0.83）因为到\n421\t    trajectory 末尾，stagnation patterns 已充分累积（长期无进展 →  structural signals 更强更一致）。\n422\t\n423\t    Confidence 分层效果最显著：conf3 → conf2 → conf1 的 f1_stag 从 0.91 骤降到 0.64  (structural)。这反映了一个链式效应：(a)\n424\t    conf1 意味着 LF 分裂 → MV label 可靠性最低 →  gold label 翻转概率最高 → 模型预测（学自 MV labels）最可能错误。(b)\n425\t    conf3 的 LF 全票一致  → MV label 几乎确定正确 → 模型预测可靠。这验证了 LF confidence 作为 prediction reliability  indicator\n426\t    的有效性，论文可建议部署时用 LF confidence 作为 alert threshold。\n427\t\n428\t    Resolved trajectories f1_stag 远高于 unresolved（structural 0.90 vs 0.76）：resolved\n429\t    tasks  的 trajectory 有明确的 \"problem → struggle → solution\" 结构，stagnation windows\n430\t    集中在  struggle 阶段且特征清晰（反复尝试 → 突然 break through）。Unresolved tasks 没有 break through  point，stagnation\n431\t    和 progress 的边界更模糊（agent 可能在 \"slowly failing\" 而非 \"clearly stuck\"）。\n432\t\n433\t    Probe 增量价值集中在三个区域：(a) LF conflict 窗口 (+3pp)——当 LF 互相矛盾时 structural  features 本质上在\n434\t    replay 这些矛盾（features ≈ LF inputs），而 probe 的 semantic signal  提供了独立的 tiebreaker。(b)\n435\t    cmd_rep-only-stag (+4pp)——cmd_rep 单独投 stag 而其他 LF 投  progress 时，structural features\n436\t    被 cmd_rep-like features 拉向 stag，但 probe 通过 semantic  analysis 能更准确判断 repetition\n437\t    是否 productive。(c) high cmd diversity stagnation (+7pp) ——这是 probe 最大的结构性优势区域：agent\n438\t    使用多样命令但语义停滞（如用 5 种不同命令做本质相同  的事），structural features 被 high diversity 误导判断为 progress，但\n439\t    embedding 能捕捉语义  相似性。这三个区域合计约占 gold stagnation 样本的 ~25%，解释了 hybrid 的 3pp 整体增益来源。\n440\t\n441\t    '\n442\t  tables:\n443\t  - name: 'Table S1: Gold F1 by Class and Method'\n444\t    columns:\n445\t    - Method\n446\t    - F1_stag\n447\t    - F1_prog\n448\t    - Macro-F1\n449\t    - Stag-Prog Gap (pp)\n450\t    rows:\n451\t    - - Structural RF\n452\t      - 0.78\n453\t      - 0.89\n454\t      - 0.84\n455\t      - 11\n456\t    - - Structural GB\n457\t      - 0.79\n458\t      - 0.89\n459\t      - 0.84\n460\t      - 10\n461\t    - - Probe (Qwen)\n462\t      - 0.72\n463\t      - 0.85\n464\t      - 0.79\n465\t      - 13\n466\t    - - Probe (BGE)\n467\t      - 0.74\n468\t      - 0.87\n469\t      - 0.81\n470\t      - 13\n471\t    - - LLM Judge\n472\t      - 0.65\n473\t      - 0.76\n474\t      - 0.71\n475\t      - 11\n476\t    - - Hybrid (RF+Probe)\n477\t      - 0.81\n478\t      - 0.9\n479\t      - 0.86\n480\t      - 9\n481\t  - name: 'Table S2: Gold F1_stag by Method × Trajectory Position'\n482\t    columns:\n483\t    - Method\n484\t    - Early (0-33%)\n485\t    - Middle (33-66%)\n486\t    - Late (66-100%)\n487\t    - Overall\n488\t    rows:\n489\t    - - Structural RF\n490\t      - 0.76\n491\t      - 0.71\n492\t      - 0.83\n493\t      - 0.78\n494\t    - - Probe (Qwen)\n495\t      - 0.7\n496\t      - 0.65\n497\t      - 0.78\n498\t      - 0.72\n499\t    - - LLM Judge\n500\t      - 0.62\n501\t      - 0.59\n502\t      - 0.7\n503\t      - 0.65\n504\t    - - Hybrid\n505\t      - 0.79\n506\t      - 0.74\n507\t      - 0.85\n508\t      - 0.81\n509\t  - name: 'Table S3: Gold F1_stag by LF Confidence Level'\n510\t    columns:\n511\t    - Method\n512\t    - conf=3\n513\t    - conf=2\n514\t    - conf=1\n515\t    rows:\n516\t    - - Structural RF\n517\t      - 0.91\n518\t      - 0.82\n519\t      - 0.64\n520\t    - - Probe (Qwen)\n521\t      - 0.88\n522\t      - 0.76\n523\t      - 0.6\n524\t    - - Hybrid\n525\t      - 0.93\n526\t      - 0.85\n527\t      - 0.68\n528\t  - name: 'Table S4: Circular Eval Inflation by Class'\n529\t    columns:\n530\t    - Method\n531\t    - F1_stag (LF)\n532\t    - F1_stag (Gold)\n533\t    - Stag Inflation\n534\t    - F1_prog (LF)\n535\t    - F1_prog (Gold)\n536\t    - Prog Inflation\n537\t    rows:\n538\t    - - Structural RF\n539\t      - 0.9928\n540\t      - 0.78\n541\t      - 21.3pp\n542\t      - 0.9974\n543\t      - 0.89\n544\t      - 10.7pp\n545\t    - - Probe (Qwen)\n546\t      - 0.8593\n547\t      - 0.72\n548\t      - 13.9pp\n549\t      - 0.9518\n550\t      - 0.85\n551\t      - 10.2pp\n552\t  - name: 'Table S5: Probe Advantage Regions on Gold'\n553\t    columns:\n554\t    - Region\n555\t    - '% of Gold Stag'\n556\t    - Structural RF\n557\t    - Probe\n558\t    - Hybrid\n559\t    - Δ (Probe−Structural)\n560\t    rows:\n561\t    - - LF Conflict\n562\t      - ~12%\n563\t      - 0.58\n564\t      - 0.61\n565\t      - 0.65\n566\t      - +3pp\n567\t    - - cmd_rep-only-stag\n568\t      - ~8%\n569\t      - 0.62\n570\t      - 0.66\n571\t      - 0.7\n572\t      - +4pp\n573\t    - - High Cmd Diversity Stag\n574\t      - ~5%\n575\t      - 0.55\n576\t      - 0.62\n577\t      - 0.66\n578\t      - +7pp\n579\t    - - All Gold Stag\n580\t      - 100%\n581\t      - 0.78\n582\t      - 0.72\n583\t      - 0.81\n584\t      - −6pp\n585\t  figures_description:\n586\t  - 'Fig S-A: Grouped bar chart — F1_stag (深色) vs F1_prog (浅色) 按方法排列。清晰展示所有方法 stagnation\n587\t    更难检测。Hybrid 的 stag-prog gap 最小 (9pp)。'\n588\t  - 'Fig S-B: Line chart — 横轴 trajectory position (early/mid/late)，纵轴 f1_stag。Structural,\n589\t    Probe, Hybrid 三条线均在 Middle 段 dip，Hybrid dip 最浅。Shaded region 标注 inter-annotator\n590\t    agreement 也在 middle 最低。'\n591\t  - 'Fig S-C: Heatmap — 行 = 方法 (structural/probe/hybrid)，列 = conf1/2/3，cell = f1_stag。conf1\n592\t    列全深色（performance cliff），conf3 列全浅色。'\n593\t  - 'Fig S-D: Stacked error Venn — 展示 structural FN 和 probe FN 在 gold stagnation 样本上的集合关系。Non-overlapping\n594\t    probe-correct / structural-wrong 区域 = hybrid 挽救的 cases (~10%)。Non-overlapping\n595\t    structural-correct / probe-wrong 区域更大 (~16%)，解释为何 structural 整体仍优。'\n596\t  analysis: 'F1_stag 分析确认 stagnation 检测是所有方法的瓶颈，且 circular eval 对 stagnation class  的\n597\t    inflation 远大于 progress class（structural: 21.3pp vs 10.7pp）——因为 LF bias 主要  是 stagnation\n598\t    over-prediction，被 gold 纠正后 stagnation class 受冲击最大。\n599\t\n600\t    三个关键交叉维度： (1) Middle position × conf1 是 performance cliff 的极端区域（structural f1_stag\n601\t    估计 ~0.52）， 这恰好也是 human annotators 最不一致的区域——说明这是 intrinsic task difficulty 而非 model  缺陷。论文应在\n602\t    Limitations 中讨论 stagnation detection 的 inherent ambiguity frontier。 (2) Probe\n603\t    的结构性优势区域（LF conflict + cmd_rep-only + high diversity stag）合计 ~25%  of gold stagnation\n604\t    samples，且这些区域 probe 优势稳定 (3-7pp)。这不是随机噪声，而是 probe  的 semantic signal 在 structural\n605\t    features 的 systematic blind spots 上的 targeted 补充。 (3) Resolved vs unresolved 的巨大差距（structural\n606\t    f1_stag 0.90 vs 0.76）提示：当前数据  中 unresolved tasks 的 stagnation 标签 inherently noisier，未来工作可考虑\n607\t    outcome-aware  label model。\n608\t\n609\t    本分析为 hybrid 推荐提供了 targeted evidence：probe 的增量价值不是统计噪声，而是系统性地  集中在 structural features\n610\t    的 blind spots。论文的实用建议变为：(a) 部署 structural monitoring  作为 primary detector；(b)\n611\t    在 LF confidence 低的区域叠加 probe 作为 secondary signal； (c) 用 LF confidence 做 alert\n612\t    threshold gating。'\n613\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7aba9a09-ed96-4e10-95c4-11fb49122c38","uuid":"4f51045f-5bc2-4c26-adbd-a104e1fc9815","timestamp":"2026-05-14T22:21:50.936Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/agent_progress_probe/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T214352/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 从 \"NL embedding 无增量价值\" 调整为 \"structural features 提供高效可迁移的强\n  baseline， semantic features 在 LF 低覆盖区域提供互补信号\"。Gold set 确认 structural 优势真实但被 circular\n  eval 放大约 15pp。新增 hybrid (structural+probe) 实验 + \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons Learned\"\n  方法论贡献段。Claim 2 (temporal dynamics) 和 Claim 3 (TLM negative) 不受 gold set 影响—— 它们是描述性/方法论发现。论文仍支撑\n  EMNLP Findings，需软化措辞、补充 hybrid 实验和 gold error analysis。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Gold Set Human Validation\n  plan_id: gold-set\n  description: '650 窗口人工标注（双标注 + 仲裁），分层采样覆盖 conf1/2/3。 五项核心功能：(1) 量化 LF-human agreement\n    整体及 per-LF；(2) gold labels 上重评所有方法； (3) 量化 circular eval inflation per-method；(4)\n    hybrid structural+probe ensemble； (5) gold-based error analysis 定位 LF 偏差根因。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    annotation_stats:\n      total_windows: 650\n      sampling_strategy: stratified by LF confidence\n      conf3_sampled: 50\n      conf2_sampled: 300\n      conf1_sampled: 300\n      inter_annotator_cohen_kappa: 0.73\n      inter_annotator_pct_agreement: 0.85\n      adjudication_needed_pct: 0.15\n    lf_human_agreement:\n      overall: 0.79\n      per_lf:\n        cmd_rep: 0.74\n        file_diff: 0.88\n        outcome_bp: 0.77\n      per_confidence:\n        conf3: 0.93\n        conf2: 0.85\n        conf1: 0.68\n      disagreement_direction:\n        lf_stag_human_prog_pct: 0.13\n        lf_prog_human_stag_pct: 0.08\n        net_lf_bias: over-predicts stagnation (driven by cmd_rep)\n    gold_method_evaluation:\n      structural_rf:\n        macro_f1: 0.84\n        f1_stag: 0.78\n        f1_prog: 0.89\n      structural_gb:\n        macro_f1: 0.84\n        f1_stag: 0.79\n        f1_prog: 0.89\n      probe_qwen:\n        macro_f1: 0.79\n        f1_stag: 0.72\n        f1_prog: 0.85\n      probe_bge:\n        macro_f1: 0.81\n        f1_stag: 0.74\n        f1_prog: 0.87\n      probe_e5:\n        macro_f1: 0.8\n        f1_stag: 0.73\n        f1_prog: 0.86\n      llm_judge:\n        macro_f1: 0.71\n        f1_stag: 0.65\n        f1_prog: 0.76\n      hybrid_structural_probe:\n        method: probability averaging (RF calibrated probs + probe sigmoid probs)\n        macro_f1: 0.86\n        f1_stag: 0.81\n        f1_prog: 0.9\n    circular_eval_inflation:\n      structural_rf:\n        lf_f1: 0.9951\n        gold_f1: 0.84\n        inflation_pp: 15.5\n      probe_qwen:\n        lf_f1: 0.9055\n        gold_f1: 0.79\n        inflation_pp: 11.5\n      llm_judge:\n        lf_f1: 0.6625\n        gold_f1: 0.71\n        inflation_pp: -4.8\n      insight: inflation 与方法对 LF inputs 的依赖度单调递增——structural (≈ LF inputs) 最大，probe\n        (trained on LF outputs) 次之，LLM (independent) 反而改善\n    gap_analysis:\n      structural_vs_probe_on_lf_pp: 8.96\n      structural_vs_probe_on_gold_pp: 5.0\n      gap_narrowing_pp: 3.96\n      structural_vs_llm_on_gold_pp: 13.0\n    cross_agent_gold_estimate:\n      structural_gb_oh_gold_f1: 0.82\n      probe_oh_gold_f1: 0.64\n      structural_vs_probe_cross_gold_pp: 18.0\n      note: 基于 in-domain inflation 外推；OH 无独立 gold set，需在 limitations 注明\n    gold_error_analysis:\n      structural_rf_on_gold:\n        total_errors_in_650: 104\n        FP: 68\n        FN: 36\n        FP_dominant_pattern: 'cmd_rep-driven LF false stagnation: agent repeats commands\n          productively (e.g. iterating grep patterns, re-running tests after edits)\n          but structural features replicate LF bias'\n        FN_dominant_pattern: 'semantic-only stagnation: diverse commands + file changes\n          that look like progress but are semantically aimless; structural features\n          lack semantic awareness'\n      probe_on_gold:\n        total_errors_in_650: 137\n        FP: 82\n        FN: 55\n        FP_dominant_pattern: inherits partial LF bias via training labels, plus probe's\n          own tendency to over-predict stagnation (asymmetric errors from confidence-gradient)\n        FN_dominant_pattern: diverse-command stagnation where adjacent-step semantic\n          similarity is low (probe relies on similarity patterns)\n      lf_disagreement_root_causes:\n        cmd_rep_false_stag_on_progress_pct: 0.18\n        file_diff_false_prog_on_stagnation_pct: 0.08\n        ob_boundary_disagreement_pct: 0.15\n        primary_bias_source: 'cmd_rep: 97.4% firing rate + 产 productive repetition\n          不应标为 stagnation 的系统性 FP'\n  result_rationale: 'LF-human agreement 79%：cmd_rep 是最大偏差来源（agreement 仅 0.74）。SWE-Agent\n    中 agent  频繁重复同一命令但目标不同（如 grep 不同 pattern、edit 后重跑 test），cmd_rep 以 97.4% firing  rate\n    将这些全部标为 stagnation。人工标注者能区分\"有目的的重复\"和\"无效循环\"，cmd_rep 不能。 file_diff 最可靠（0.88），因为文件是否改变是\n    objective signal——少量 false prog 来自 cosmetic  edits（格式修改、注释增删），人工判定为无实质进展。OB 的\n    disagreement（0.77）主要源于 lagging  特性：OB 从 task outcome 向前传播 6.7 步，boundary 窗口的标签是机械推断而非窗口本身的\n    ground  truth，人工标注者在这些边界窗口的判断更细致。conf1 窗口 agreement 骤降至 0.68 因为这些窗口本身  就是 LF 分裂的——三个\n    LF 各投不同方向，MV 勉强决定标签，人工在此区域有更独立的判断。\n\n    Structural RF 从 0.9951 降至 0.84（inflation 15.5pp）：这是 circular eval 的核心案例。 30 个\n    structural features 中包含 command_repetition_ratio、unique_command_ratio 等特征， 它们与\n    cmd_rep LF 的输入高度重叠——RF 在 LF labels 上近完美是因为它 reverse-engineer 了  LF 的决策规则。在 LF\n    正确的 79% 窗口上 structural 仍近完美（~0.98），但在 LF 错误的 21%  窗口上系统性地跟随 LF 方向（gold accuracy\n    ~0.20），因为训练目标就是 LF labels。\n\n    Probe 从 0.906 降至 0.79（inflation 11.5pp），inflation 低于 structural 4pp，因为 probe  使用\n    NL embedding 而非直接使用 LF-input features。在 LF 错误的 21% 窗口上，probe 有约 35%  的概率给出正确的\n    gold 方向（vs structural 的 ~20%），因为 semantic similarity patterns 部分  independent\n    of LF rules——例如 probe 能检测\"命令不同但语义重复\"（改变命令名但逻辑相同）的  stagnation，这类 case 骗过 cmd_rep\n    但 embedding space 中 similarity 仍高。这解释了 gap  从 9pp 收窄到 5pp：structural 的 inflation\n    更大，probe 的 independent signal 在 LF-错误区  发挥了保底作用。\n\n    LLM judge 从 0.6625 提升至 0.71（+4.8pp）：LLM 从未在 LF labels 上训练，其判断完全独立。 在 LF labels\n    下，LLM 被惩罚的典型 case 是\"LLM 正确识别了停滞但 LF majority 投 progress\" ——主要发生在 file_diff 投 progress（有文件改动）但实际只是\n    cosmetic change 的窗口。 Gold labels 纠正了约 8% 的这类 case（从\"LLM 错\"翻转为\"LLM 对\"），部分被约 3%\n    的反向 case  抵消（LLM 说 progress 但 gold 说 stagnation），净提升 ~5pp。LLM 仍低于 structural 13pp  因为\n    zero-shot 缺乏 task-specific calibration + context window 限制。\n\n    Hybrid 0.86 = structural 0.84 + 2pp 增益：增益来自约 10% 的 gold 窗口——structural 跟随  LF\n    犯错（主要是 cmd_rep false stag），但 probe 的 semantic signal 给出正确方向。Probability  averaging\n    让 probe 的 moderate confidence (0.6-0.7) 拉动 structural 的 high-confidence  wrong\n    prediction (0.9+)，在约一半这类 case 上翻转了最终预测。另有 ~11% 窗口两者都错，hybrid  无法挽救。2pp 虽小但稳定（bootstrapped\n    95% CI 预计 [1.2, 3.1]pp），且增益集中在高价值区域 （LF conflict windows 和 cmd_rep-only-stag）。\n\n    Cross-agent gold 估算 0.82：基于 in-domain 的 inflation 规律（~15pp）外推。GB 在 OH  LF labels\n    上 0.967，减去 ~15pp inflation ≈ 0.82。Probe 在 OH 上 gold 估算更低（~0.64， 从 LF-FT 0.751\n    减去 ~11pp），structural 迁移优势在 gold 上仍成立（0.82 vs 0.64 = 18pp gap）， 只是比 LF-label 的\n    21.6pp gap 略窄。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table G1: LF–Human Agreement by LF × Confidence Level'\n    columns:\n    - LF / Confidence\n    - conf=3 (n=50)\n    - conf=2 (n=300)\n    - conf=1 (n=300)\n    - Overall (n=650)\n    rows:\n    - - cmd_rep\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.74\n    - - file_diff\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.88\n    - - outcome_bp\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.77\n    - - MV Label\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.79\n  - name: 'Table G2: Method Comparison — LF Labels vs Gold Labels'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - LF Macro-F1\n    - Gold Macro-F1\n    - Inflation (pp)\n    - Gold F1_stag\n    - Gold F1_prog\n    rows:\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.9951\n      - 0.84\n      - −15.5\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.89\n    - - Structural GB\n      - 0.9951\n      - 0.84\n      - −15.5\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.89\n    - - Probe (Qwen-0.6B)\n      - 0.9055\n      - 0.79\n      - −11.5\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.85\n    - - Probe (BGE-m3)\n      - 0.9413\n      - 0.81\n      - −13.1\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.87\n    - - Probe (E5-large-v2)\n      - 0.9363\n      - 0.8\n      - −13.6\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.86\n    - - LLM Judge (Sonnet)\n      - 0.6625\n      - 0.71\n      - '+4.8'\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.76\n    - - Hybrid (RF + Probe)\n      - —\n      - 0.86\n      - —\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.9\n  - name: 'Table G3: Circular Evaluation Inflation — Mechanism Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Circularity Source\n    - LF-label F1\n    - Gold F1\n    - '|Δ|'\n    rows:\n    - - Structural RF\n      - Features ≈ LF inputs (reverse-engineering)\n      - 0.9951\n      - 0.84\n      - 15.5pp\n    - - Probe\n      - Trained on LF outputs (label noise propagation)\n      - 0.9055\n      - 0.79\n      - 11.5pp\n    - - LLM Judge\n      - Fully independent (zero-shot, no LF exposure)\n      - 0.6625\n      - 0.71\n      - +4.8pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig G-A: Paired bar chart — 每种方法在 LF labels (灰) vs gold labels (蓝) 上的 macro-F1。连线标注\n    inflation magnitude。LLM Judge 是唯一向上的箭头。右侧 annotation 标注 gap 收窄 (9pp → 5pp)。'\n  - 'Fig G-B: Heatmap — 行 = 3 个 LF, 列 = conf1/2/3, cell value = agreement rate。cmd_rep\n    × conf1 格子颜色最深 (0.63)，file_diff × conf3 最浅 (0.96)。对角线趋势清晰。'\n  - 'Fig G-C: 2×3 grid of confusion matrices (gold labels) — structural RF, probe,\n    LLM judge 各一行，raw counts 和 normalized 各一列。Structural 的 FP 集中在 cmd_rep-driven 区域，probe\n    的 FN 集中在 diverse-stagnation 区域。'\n  - 'Fig G-D: Inflation scatter — x = LF-label F1, y = gold F1, 对角线 = no inflation。每个点\n    = 一种方法/变体。Structural 系列远离对角线（右下），LLM 在对角线上方（左上），Probe 居中。'\n  analysis: 'GO/NO-GO 判定：GO with modifications。\n\n    Gold set 确认 structural > probe > LLM 的排序在真实标签上成立（0.84 > 0.79 > 0.71）， core finding\n    未被颠覆。但 circular eval inflation 显著（structural 15.5pp, probe 11.5pp）， 论文必须正面处理。\n\n    需要的修改： (1) Claim 1 措辞从 \"NL embedding 无增量价值\" 改为 \"structural features 提供高效可迁移的 强\n    baseline；semantic features 在 LF 低覆盖区（cmd_rep-only-stag、LF conflict windows） 提供互补信号，hybrid\n    ensemble 在 gold set 上达到最优 0.86\"。 (2) 新增 Section 6.X \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons\n    Learned\"，quantify inflation per method， 提出 \"circularity gradient\" 概念（越接近 LF inputs\n    → inflation 越大），作为 weak supervision  社区的方法论贡献。 (3) cmd_rep 的 LF 偏差分析（97.4% firing\n    rate → 18% false stag on gold → net stagnation  over-prediction）作为 LF 设计的实证教训。\n    (4) Abstract 和 Introduction 的 headline result 从 \"0.995 in-domain\" 改为  \"0.84 gold-validated,\n    0.86 hybrid\"——仍是强 result，但更诚实。\n\n    Claim 2 (temporal dynamics) 不受影响——cmd_rep leading/OB lagging 是 descriptive finding，\n    不依赖 gold set。Claim 3 (TLM negative) 同理。\n\n    EMNLP Findings 仍 sufficient：gold-validated structural baseline 0.84 + hybrid 0.86\n    +  circular eval methodology + temporal dynamics + TLM failure analysis = 五项贡献，\n    分量足够。\n\n    '\n- name: F1_stag Per-Class Detailed Breakdown\n  plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n  description: '在 gold labels 上对 stagnation class 的 F1 (f1_stag) 进行多维度分层分析： 按方法、trajectory\n    position、LF confidence、task outcome、LF 投票 pattern 展开。 定位 stagnation detection\n    的系统性难点和 probe 增量价值的具体区域。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gold_f1_by_class_and_method:\n      structural_rf:\n        f1_stag: 0.78\n        f1_prog: 0.89\n        stag_prog_gap_pp: 11\n      structural_gb:\n        f1_stag: 0.79\n        f1_prog: 0.89\n        stag_prog_gap_pp: 10\n      probe_qwen:\n        f1_stag: 0.72\n        f1_prog: 0.85\n        stag_prog_gap_pp: 13\n      probe_bge:\n        f1_stag: 0.74\n        f1_prog: 0.87\n        stag_prog_gap_pp: 13\n      llm_judge:\n        f1_stag: 0.65\n        f1_prog: 0.76\n        stag_prog_gap_pp: 11\n      hybrid:\n        f1_stag: 0.81\n        f1_prog: 0.9\n        stag_prog_gap_pp: 9\n    gold_f1_stag_by_trajectory_position:\n      early_0_33:\n        structural_rf: 0.76\n        probe_qwen: 0.7\n        llm_judge: 0.62\n        hybrid: 0.79\n        n_windows: ~140\n      middle_33_66:\n        structural_rf: 0.71\n        probe_qwen: 0.65\n        llm_judge: 0.59\n        hybrid: 0.74\n        n_windows: ~140\n      late_66_100:\n        structural_rf: 0.83\n        probe_qwen: 0.78\n        llm_judge: 0.7\n        hybrid: 0.85\n        n_windows: ~370\n    gold_f1_stag_by_lf_confidence:\n      conf3:\n        structural_rf: 0.91\n        probe_qwen: 0.88\n        hybrid: 0.93\n        n_windows: ~50\n      conf2:\n        structural_rf: 0.82\n        probe_qwen: 0.76\n        hybrid: 0.85\n        n_windows: ~300\n      conf1:\n        structural_rf: 0.64\n        probe_qwen: 0.6\n        hybrid: 0.68\n        n_windows: ~300\n    gold_f1_stag_by_outcome:\n      resolved:\n        structural_rf: 0.9\n        probe_qwen: 0.85\n        hybrid: 0.92\n      unresolved:\n        structural_rf: 0.76\n        probe_qwen: 0.7\n        hybrid: 0.79\n    probe_advantage_regions:\n      lf_conflict_windows:\n        description: 3 个 LF 互相矛盾的窗口\n        structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.58\n        probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.61\n        hybrid_f1_stag: 0.65\n        delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 3\n      cmd_rep_only_stag:\n        description: 仅 cmd_rep 投 stagnation，其他 LF 投 progress\n        structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.62\n        probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.66\n        hybrid_f1_stag: 0.7\n        delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 4\n      high_cmd_diversity_stag:\n        description: gold=stagnation 但 unique_cmd_ratio > 0.7 的窗口\n        structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.55\n        probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.62\n        hybrid_f1_stag: 0.66\n        delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 7\n        note: structural 在此最弱因为高 cmd diversity 误导 structural features 判断为 progress\n    inflation_by_class:\n      structural_rf:\n        f1_stag_lf: 0.9928\n        f1_stag_gold: 0.78\n        inflation_stag_pp: 21.3\n        f1_prog_lf: 0.9974\n        f1_prog_gold: 0.89\n        inflation_prog_pp: 10.7\n      probe_qwen:\n        f1_stag_lf: 0.8593\n        f1_stag_gold: 0.72\n        inflation_stag_pp: 13.9\n        f1_prog_lf: 0.9518\n        f1_prog_gold: 0.85\n        inflation_prog_pp: 10.2\n      note: stagnation class inflation >> progress class inflation 对所有方法成立，因为 LF 的系统性\n        bias 主要影响 stagnation 标签\n  result_rationale: '所有方法 f1_stag < f1_prog（gap 9-13pp），三个原因叠加： (1) Class imbalance\n    — SWE-Agent stagnation 仅占 ~28% 样本，precision/recall 对少数类更敏感， 少量 FP/FN 即大幅影响 F1；\n    (2) cmd_rep 的系统性 false stagnation（18% over-prediction on gold）在 gold 上被纠正， 原本被\n    LF labels \"验证\"的 stagnation 预测现在变成 FP。这对 structural features 打击最大 （f1_stag inflation\n    21.3pp vs f1_prog 10.7pp），因为 structural features 最依赖 cmd_rep-like  inputs；probe\n    受影响较小（13.9pp vs 10.2pp）因其有部分 independent semantic signal； (3) Stagnation 本身语义多样性高于\n    progress——progress 有明确的 positive signals（new file,  test pass, successful build），stagnation\n    的表现形式更多（无效编辑、循环尝试、反复查看同一代码、 语义重复但命令不同），更难用统一特征捕捉。\n\n    Trajectory 中段最难（structural f1_stag 0.71，比 early 低 5pp、比 late 低 12pp）：中段是  agent\n    策略探索和转换的关键区，行为 pattern 最模糊。Agent 可能正在 productive exploration  （尝试不同方向）或 aimless\n    wandering（反复尝试已失败的策略变体），两者的 structural footprint  高度相似——都有命令多样性、有文件变更、无明显循环。人工标注者在此区域也最不一致（inter-annotator  agreement\n    比 early/late 低 ~10pp），说明这是 intrinsic ambiguity 而非 model failure。Late  段最容易（0.83）因为到\n    trajectory 末尾，stagnation patterns 已充分累积（长期无进展 →  structural signals 更强更一致）。\n\n    Confidence 分层效果最显著：conf3 → conf2 → conf1 的 f1_stag 从 0.91 骤降到 0.64  (structural)。这反映了一个链式效应：(a)\n    conf1 意味着 LF 分裂 → MV label 可靠性最低 →  gold label 翻转概率最高 → 模型预测（学自 MV labels）最可能错误。(b)\n    conf3 的 LF 全票一致  → MV label 几乎确定正确 → 模型预测可靠。这验证了 LF confidence 作为 prediction reliability  indicator\n    的有效性，论文可建议部署时用 LF confidence 作为 alert threshold。\n\n    Resolved trajectories f1_stag 远高于 unresolved（structural 0.90 vs 0.76）：resolved\n    tasks  的 trajectory 有明确的 \"problem → struggle → solution\" 结构，stagnation windows\n    集中在  struggle 阶段且特征清晰（反复尝试 → 突然 break through）。Unresolved tasks 没有 break through  point，stagnation\n    和 progress 的边界更模糊（agent 可能在 \"slowly failing\" 而非 \"clearly stuck\"）。\n\n    Probe 增量价值集中在三个区域：(a) LF conflict 窗口 (+3pp)——当 LF 互相矛盾时 structural  features 本质上在\n    replay 这些矛盾（features ≈ LF inputs），而 probe 的 semantic signal  提供了独立的 tiebreaker。(b)\n    cmd_rep-only-stag (+4pp)——cmd_rep 单独投 stag 而其他 LF 投  progress 时，structural features\n    被 cmd_rep-like features 拉向 stag，但 probe 通过 semantic  analysis 能更准确判断 repetition\n    是否 productive。(c) high cmd diversity stagnation (+7pp) ——这是 probe 最大的结构性优势区域：agent\n    使用多样命令但语义停滞（如用 5 种不同命令做本质相同  的事），structural features 被 high diversity 误导判断为 progress，但\n    embedding 能捕捉语义  相似性。这三个区域合计约占 gold stagnation 样本的 ~25%，解释了 hybrid 的 3pp 整体增益来源。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S1: Gold F1 by Class and Method'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - F1_stag\n    - F1_prog\n    - Macro-F1\n    - Stag-Prog Gap (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.84\n      - 11\n    - - Structural GB\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.84\n      - 10\n    - - Probe (Qwen)\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.79\n      - 13\n    - - Probe (BGE)\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.81\n      - 13\n    - - LLM Judge\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.71\n      - 11\n    - - Hybrid (RF+Probe)\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.86\n      - 9\n  - name: 'Table S2: Gold F1_stag by Method × Trajectory Position'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Early (0-33%)\n    - Middle (33-66%)\n    - Late (66-100%)\n    - Overall\n    rows:\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.78\n    - - Probe (Qwen)\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.72\n    - - LLM Judge\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.65\n    - - Hybrid\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.81\n  - name: 'Table S3: Gold F1_stag by LF Confidence Level'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - conf=3\n    - conf=2\n    - conf=1\n    rows:\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.64\n    - - Probe (Qwen)\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.6\n    - - Hybrid\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.68\n  - name: 'Table S4: Circular Eval Inflation by Class'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - F1_stag (LF)\n    - F1_stag (Gold)\n    - Stag Inflation\n    - F1_prog (LF)\n    - F1_prog (Gold)\n    - Prog Inflation\n    rows:\n    - - Structural RF\n      - 0.9928\n      - 0.78\n      - 21.3pp\n      - 0.9974\n      - 0.89\n      - 10.7pp\n    - - Probe (Qwen)\n      - 0.8593\n      - 0.72\n      - 13.9pp\n      - 0.9518\n      - 0.85\n      - 10.2pp\n  - name: 'Table S5: Probe Advantage Regions on Gold'\n    columns:\n    - Region\n    - '% of Gold Stag'\n    - Structural RF\n    - Probe\n    - Hybrid\n    - Δ (Probe−Structural)\n    rows:\n    - - LF Conflict\n      - ~12%\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.65\n      - +3pp\n    - - cmd_rep-only-stag\n      - ~8%\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.7\n      - +4pp\n    - - High Cmd Diversity Stag\n      - ~5%\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.66\n      - +7pp\n    - - All Gold Stag\n      - 100%\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.81\n      - −6pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S-A: Grouped bar chart — F1_stag (深色) vs F1_prog (浅色) 按方法排列。清晰展示所有方法 stagnation\n    更难检测。Hybrid 的 stag-prog gap 最小 (9pp)。'\n  - 'Fig S-B: Line chart — 横轴 trajectory position (early/mid/late)，纵轴 f1_stag。Structural,\n    Probe, Hybrid 三条线均在 Middle 段 dip，Hybrid dip 最浅。Shaded region 标注 inter-annotator\n    agreement 也在 middle 最低。'\n  - 'Fig S-C: Heatmap — 行 = 方法 (structural/probe/hybrid)，列 = conf1/2/3，cell = f1_stag。conf1\n    列全深色（performance cliff），conf3 列全浅色。'\n  - 'Fig S-D: Stacked error Venn — 展示 structural FN 和 probe FN 在 gold stagnation 样本上的集合关系。Non-overlapping\n    probe-correct / structural-wrong 区域 = hybrid 挽救的 cases (~10%)。Non-overlapping\n    structural-correct / probe-wrong 区域更大 (~16%)，解释为何 structural 整体仍优。'\n  analysis: 'F1_stag 分析确认 stagnation 检测是所有方法的瓶颈，且 circular eval 对 stagnation class  的\n    inflation 远大于 progress class（structural: 21.3pp vs 10.7pp）——因为 LF bias 主要  是 stagnation\n    over-prediction，被 gold 纠正后 stagnation class 受冲击最大。\n\n    三个关键交叉维度： (1) Middle position × conf1 是 performance cliff 的极端区域（structural f1_stag\n    估计 ~0.52）， 这恰好也是 human annotators 最不一致的区域——说明这是 intrinsic task difficulty 而非 model  缺陷。论文应在\n    Limitations 中讨论 stagnation detection 的 inherent ambiguity frontier。 (2) Probe\n    的结构性优势区域（LF conflict + cmd_rep-only + high diversity stag）合计 ~25%  of gold stagnation\n    samples，且这些区域 probe 优势稳定 (3-7pp)。这不是随机噪声，而是 probe  的 semantic signal 在 structural\n    features 的 systematic blind spots 上的 targeted 补充。 (3) Resolved vs unresolved 的巨大差距（structural\n    f1_stag 0.90 vs 0.76）提示：当前数据  中 unresolved tasks 的 stagnation 标签 inherently noisier，未来工作可考虑\n    outcome-aware  label model。\n\n    本分析为 hybrid 推荐提供了 targeted evidence：probe 的增量价值不是统计噪声，而是系统性地  集中在 structural features\n    的 blind spots。论文的实用建议变为：(a) 部署 structural monitoring  作为 primary detector；(b)\n    在 LF confidence 低的区域叠加 probe 作为 secondary signal； (c) 用 LF confidence 做 alert\n    threshold gating。'\n","numLines":613,"startLine":1,"totalLines":613}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011FHDbJsM7F8kYTUfcoEGGP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the paper and review context carefully. I need to dispatch two reviewers (R1: methods + experiments, R2: novelty + related work) and then run a full roundtable process.\n\nLet me first thoroughly understand the paper:\n\n**Title:** \"Structural Features Provide Strong Baselines for Agent Progress Stagnation Detection: A Gold-Validated Empirical Study with Weak Supervision\"\n\n**Core problem:** Detecting progress stagnation in LLM coding agents (SWE-Agent, OpenHands) using weak supervision.\n\n**Approach:**\n- 3 labeling functions (LFs): cmd_rep, file_diff, outcome_bp → majority vote\n\n\n- 4 detection methods: structural features (RF/GB), neural embedding probes, LLM-as-judge, hybrid ensemble\n- 650-window gold set with human annotation for validation\n\n**Key findings:**\n1. Structural features = strong baseline (0.84 gold F1 in-domain, 0.82 cross-agent)\n2. Hybrid ensemble best overall (0.86)\n3. Circular evaluation inflates results (structural: 15.5pp, probe: 11.5pp)\n4. LF temporal dynamics are agent-specific\n5. Temporal label models fail to improve over MV\n\nNow let me check the review_context.yaml for assignment details.\n\nLooking at the experiment coverage, the gold set validation and per-class F1 breakdowns are both well documented in the paper. I'll set up the two reviewers as parallel agents—R1 focusing on methods and experiments, R2 on novelty and related work—then bring them together for discussion.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22419,"cache_read_input_tokens":22911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22419},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7aba9a09-ed96-4e10-95c4-11fb49122c38","uuid":"3fa404aa-5ede-4753-a4cf-7cac8ea940a3"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011FHDbJsM7F8kYTUfcoEGGP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've read the paper (9 pages) and the review context. Now dispatching two reviewers in parallel for the full review process."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22419,"cache_read_input_tokens":22911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22419},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7aba9a09-ed96-4e10-95c4-11fb49122c38","uuid":"6e5cd97f-7cda-4b54-a05f-aec818845a52"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011FHDbJsM7F8kYTUfcoEGGP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JPpAymd7RoVNiBpnEnu2yg","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R1: Methods + Experiments review","prompt":"You are Reviewer R1 for a top ML venue review (acceptance rate ~25%, 6-point scale: 1=Strong Reject, 6=Strong Accept). Your focus: **methods and experiments**.\n\n## Paper Summary\nTitle: \"Structural Features Provide Strong Baselines for Agent Progress Stagnation Detection: A Gold-Validated Empirical Study with Weak Supervision\"\n\nThe paper studies progress stagnation detection in LLM coding agents (SWE-Agent, OpenHands) via weak supervision. Three labeling functions (LFs)—command repetition (cmd_rep), file diff frequency (file_diff), and outcome backpropagation (OB)—generate noisy window-level labels aggregated by majority vote. Four detection paradigms are compared: (1) structural feature classifiers (30 handcrafted features, RF/GB), (2) neural embedding probes (Qwen-0.6B, BGE-m3, E5-large-v2), (3) LLM-as-judge (Claude Sonnet zero-shot), (4) hybrid ensemble (probability averaging of RF + probe). A 650-window human-annotated gold set validates all methods.\n\n## Key Results (from paper)\n- Gold F1: Structural RF 0.84, Probe (BGE) 0.81, LLM Judge 0.71, Hybrid 0.86\n- Circular evaluation inflation: Structural 15.5pp, Probe 11.5pp, LLM Judge −4.8pp (improves on gold)\n- Stagnation class inflation >> progress class (Structural: 21.3pp vs 10.7pp)\n- LF-human agreement: 79% overall; file_diff best (0.88), cmd_rep worst (0.74)\n- Cross-agent: Structural GB achieves LF-label 0.967 on OpenHands; gold-equivalent estimated ~0.82\n- Probe advantage regions: LF conflict (+3pp), cmd_rep-only-stag (+4pp), high cmd diversity stag (+7pp)\n- Mid-trajectory stagnation hardest (F1_stag 0.71 structural); late easiest (0.83)\n- 3 temporal label models (TWV, HMM, Lag-aware HMM) all fail to beat MV\n- cmd_rep reverses role across agents: leads by −1.87 on SWE-Agent, lags by +3.32 on OpenHands\n\n## Five Claimed Contributions\n1. Structural baseline discovery (0.84 gold F1, 0.82 cross-agent)\n2. Hybrid complementarity (0.86 gold F1 from structural+probe)\n3. Circular evaluation analysis (\"circularity gradient\")\n4. LF temporal dynamics characterization\n5. Temporal label model negative finding\n\n## Experimental Design Reference (from review_context.yaml)\nTwo imagined experiments:\n1. **Gold Set Human Validation** (plan_id: gold-set): 650 windows, stratified sampling (50 conf=3, 300 conf=2, 300 conf=1), dual annotation + adjudication. Expected κ=0.73. Core deliverables: LF-human agreement, gold method evaluation, circular eval inflation quantification, hybrid ensemble, gold error analysis. All expected results are present in the paper.\n2. **F1_stag Per-Class Detailed Breakdown** (plan_id: f1-stag-analysis): Multi-dimensional stratified analysis of stagnation F1 by method, trajectory position, LF confidence, task outcome, LF vote pattern. Probe advantage region analysis. Present in the paper (Tables 5-8).\n\n## Your Task\nProduce a structured review covering:\n\n### 1. Summary (2-3 sentences)\n### 2. Strengths (bulleted, focus on methods/experiments)\n### 3. Weaknesses (bulleted, focus on methods/experiments)\n### 4. Detailed Comments\nAddress specifically:\n- Soundness of the weak supervision framework (3 LFs, MV aggregation)\n- Gold set construction quality (sampling strategy, annotation process, κ=0.73)\n- Experimental rigor: are results statistically validated? Confidence intervals? Significance tests?\n- Circular evaluation analysis: is the \"circularity gradient\" concept well-supported?\n- Cross-agent generalization claims (no independent gold set for OpenHands)\n- Hybrid ensemble: is probability averaging well-motivated? Alternatives considered?\n- Temporal label model experiments: sufficient exploration?\n- Missing baselines or ablations\n- Reproducibility concerns\n\n### 5. Questions for Authors (3-5)\n### 6. Scores\n- Soundness (1-4)\n- Contribution (1-4)  \n- Overall recommendation (1-6 scale)\n- Confidence (1-5)\n\nBe rigorous and fair. This is a solid empirical paper; identify genuine weaknesses without being dismissive.","model":"opus"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":22419,"cache_read_input_tokens":22911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":22419},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7aba9a09-ed96-4e10-95c4-11fb49122c38","uuid":"a177c124-2fc1-48b3-9f33-2834c2ef7955"}
