change how the community thinks about agent monitoring?\n- **Framing**: Is the paper better suited for a systems/applications venue vs. a methods venue?\n- **Broken references**: The paper has [??] citations for cycle detectors—assess impact\n- **Scope of contribution**: 5 claimed contributions—are they each substantial enough?\n\n### 5. Questions for Authors (3-5)\n### 6. Scores\n- Novelty (1-4)\n- Significance (1-4)\n- Overall recommendation (1-6 scale)\n- Confidence (1-5)\n\nBe rigorous but constructive. Assess whether the combination of contributions reaches the bar, even if individual components are not groundbreaking.","uuid":"9f8e4bf5-bcfd-46cc-906d-a4bd31be5306","session_id":"7aba9a09-ed96-4e10-95c4-11fb49122c38"}
