 cross-domain, cmd_rep reversal\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: TLM 彻底判死：structural-on-twv 证明 TWV 标签劣化下游分类器（最高 -21.7pp），三种 TLM 实现全部失败。论文\\\\n    anchor 必须 pivot 到 structural signal discovery + circular eval methodology + TLM\\\\n    negative finding\\\\n  rationale: structural-on-twv 实验三条 critical 证据叠加：(1) TWV-trained 分类器在所有场景下劣于 MV-trained（in-domain\\\\n    -4.9pp, cross-agent -21.7pp, conf≥2 -1.8pp）；(2) 此前 twv-ablation 已证明 TWV 在绝大多数\\\\n    σ 下有害；(3) HMM stag overpredict + lag-aware HMM 仅追平 MV。TLM 的 downstream impact\\\\n    论点被封杀——即使 σ=2 有 +0.57pp 改进也不传递到下游。三种实现（TWV/HMM/lag-aware HMM）全军覆没。论文需要新 anchor：(a)\\\\n    structural signal discovery (0.9951/0.967) 升为 primary contribution；(b) circular\\\\n    eval methodology 作为方法论贡献；(c) TLM 作为 well-motivated negative finding。Gold set 标注仍是唯一关键路径——验证\\\\n    structural signals 不只是 circular eval artifact。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: structural-on-twv\\\\n    role: decisive\\\\n    result: 'TWV labels degrade downstream classifiers: in-domain -4.9pp, cross-agent\\\\n      -21.7pp, conf≥2 -1.8pp'\\\\n  - exp_id: twv-ablation\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: TWV harmful for most σ values\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: HMM stag overpredict; lag-aware HMM only ties MV 0.8936\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: alternative_anchor\\\\n    result: Structural features 0.967 cross-agent, new primary contribution candidate\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n  - D037\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: D039 \\\\\\\"TLM 判死\\\\\\\" 结论暂缓：Reviewer 发现 σ=2.0 关键诊断未运行 + cross-domain 结果存在 label\\\\n    mismatch confound\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer WARNING 报告指出：(1) run_twv_no_temporal_s2.py 已写好但从未执行——σ=2.0 是唯一正收益点，不知是\\\\n    temporal alignment 还是 smoothing；(2) structural_on_twv 的 GB cross-domain -21.7pp\\\\n    是 train(TWV)/eval(MV) 标签不匹配的 confound，不能解读为 TWV 劣化分类器。因此之前 D039 基于不完整证据判 TLM 死亡过早。等\\\\n    σ=2.0 诊断结果再做最终判决。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temporal-label-model\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: pending σ=2.0 diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: twv-ablation\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: σ=3.0 negative, σ=2.0 untested\\\\n  - exp_id: structural_on_twv\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: label mismatch confound\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 写入 experiment_plan.yaml (32 experiments) + 更新 paper_framing.md 补充 OH cmd_rep\\\\n    消融数据 + 触发 dream_simulate(full) 验证 D039 framing\\\\n  rationale: D039 pivot 后 experiment_plan.yaml 一直为空，阻塞 coverage matrix 和 dream。现已写入\\\\n    32 个实验映射 5 个 claims，coverage 75%。framing 补充了 oh-cmdrep-ablation (+21.6pp)、encoder-agnostic、window-size、data-scaling\\\\n    四个新完成实验的数据。触发 dream full review 验证新 framing 在 EMNLP 审稿下是否站得住。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-cmdrep-ablation\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: F1 0.7512→0.9272 (+21.6pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: data-scaling-v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 10-100% complete curve\\\\n  - exp_id: ablation-window-size\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: k=5 optimal 0.9309\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-full-finetune\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: macro_f1=0.7512\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: Baseline 数值引用规则：跨域 claim 统一用 cross-agent-structural (0.9674)，TWV 对比统一用\\\\n    structural-on-twv (0.9698)，禁止混用；补 3-seed 结构 baseline\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 paper_results_compilation 发现 cross-agent-structural (0.9674)\\\\n    与 structural-on-twv (0.9698) 差 0.24pp，论文同时引用两个数字会被审稿人质疑。同时 structural baseline\\\\n    均为单 seed 无方差，需补 3-seed。RF/GB sklearn 模型跑秒级，成本极低。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: '0.9674'\\\\n  - exp_id: structural-on-twv\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: '0.9698'\\\\n  - exp_id: non-nlp-baseline\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: '0.9951'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 冻结跨域结构特征数字（GB 0.967, +21.6pp），启动数据管道一致性调查\\\\n  rationale: v2 paired bootstrap 在匹配 OH test split 上 GB=0.6936，与 registry cross-agent-structural\\\\n    的 0.9674 差 27.4pp。三条证据指向数据管道不一致：窗口数不匹配（143K vs 150K）、标签来源不同（oh_labels vs majority_label）、训练配置差异。在根因确认前，论文不能引用这些数字。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: 原始评估\\\\n    result: GB 0.9674 on 150K windows\\\\n  - exp_id: bootstrap-crossdomain-fix\\\\n    role: 匹配评估\\\\n    result: GB 0.6936 on 20.8K test split\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D044\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: BGE-M3 multiseed 论文呈现：全报 mean±std，E5 做主力 encoder-agnostic 证据\\\\n  rationale: E5-large 0.9381±0.002 极稳定，BGE-M3 0.9084±0.053 seed 123 异常低（0.847）。encoder-agnostic\\\\n    claim 仍成立（3/3 encoder 均>0.84，E5+STE 2/3 极稳定）。论文主表用 E5，BGE-M3 诚实报告含 variance，不\\\\n    cherry-pick。seed 123 异常可能是 split 问题，不影响 claim 但需注明。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: encoder-e5\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 0.9381±0.002\\\\n  - exp_id: encoder-bge\\\\n    role: secondary\\\\n    result: 0.9084±0.053\\\\n  - exp_id: probe-multiseed\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 0.9185±0.011\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D045\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: BGE-M3 论文呈现：E5-large 为主力 encoder-agnostic 证据，BGE-M3 报 median + per-seed\\\\n    breakdown\\\\n  rationale: E5-large 3-seed std=0.002 极稳定，BGE-M3 seed 123 异常低（0.847 vs 0.941/0.936），3\\\\n    seed 中 1 个 outlier 导致 mean±std 失真（0.908±0.053）。论文策略：E5-large 0.9381±0.002 为 primary\\\\n    encoder-agnostic evidence；BGE-M3 报 median 0.936 + appendix 给 per-seed 表格，注明 seed\\\\n    sensitivity。两个 encoder 各有 2/3+ seeds 达 0.93+ 水平，encoder-agnostic claim 成立。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: encoder-e5\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 0.9381±0.002 multiseed\\\\n  - exp_id: encoder-bge\\\\n    role: supplementary\\\\n    result: median 0.936, seed 123 outlier 0.847\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D046\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 cmd_rep ablation 数字 +21.6pp → +17.6pp，paper_framing.md + writing_plan.yaml\\\\n    共 4 处\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现 0.9272-0.7512=0.1760=17.6pp，21.6pp 是 cross-agent-structural\\\\n    的 struct_gb_advantage_pp (0.9674-0.7512) 被错误移植到 cmd_rep ablation 语境。introduction.tex\\\\n    原本正确（17.6pp），framing 和 plan 文档未同步。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: oh-cmdrep-ablation\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: 0.9272-0.7512=17.6pp\\\\n  - exp_id: cross-agent-structural\\\\n    role: 误源\\\\n    result: struct_gb_advantage=21.6pp 被错误引用\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 36521, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01H4Vmi7xGEJaYwTtAZcN8aE","session_id":"7aba9a09-ed96-4e10-95c4-11fb49122c38","uuid":"fea0bbe8-cfde-4393-a749-24bef93550f0","timestamp":"2026-05-14T22:23:15.979Z"}
