 at the window level.\nartifacts/_project/paper/conclusion_fac7bf.tex:24:Most critically, evaluation against human-annotated ground truth---for which we have prepared a 650-window gold set with a validated annotation pipeline---will determine whether structural features detect \\emph{real} stagnation or merely reconstruct labeling function outputs."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01H4Vmi7xGEJaYwTtAZcN8aE","session_id":"7aba9a09-ed96-4e10-95c4-11fb49122c38","uuid":"63eee79a-ddcf-4f0b-86d8-441263e61c92","timestamp":"2026-05-14T22:23:54.597Z"}
